    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d441">

                <pb facs="0514" n="454" sameAs="frus:frus1895p1/pg454"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Mr.
                            Jackson</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-07-25"><hi rendition="#italic">July 25,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>It is reported that Louis Stern, wealthy and honorable New York merchant, is in
                    trouble at Kissingen, charged with insulting German official. Ascertain facts
                    and do all you properly can.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Adee</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Acting</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
